! Game text
| Use 3 Force to cancel {{Errata hl|any starship battle}}. OR Cancel Besieged. OR Release (move for free) all your characters from a captured starship to your side of any docking bay site. || Use 3 Force to cancel {{Errata hl|a battle just initiated at a system or sector}}. OR Cancel Besieged. OR Release (move for free) all your characters from a captured starship to your side of any docking bay site.
